menu "PokéDock development features"
config POKEDOCK_HMI_START
    bool "Start EXPERIMENTAL BSP-backed LVGL demo (unverified physical panel)"
    default n
    help
      Off: console-only M0; safe initial firmware skeleton.
      On: initialize Waveshare managed BSP and LVGL and show a basic
      HOME/FOCUS/COUNTDOWN demo. Factory flashing/recovery must be ready;
      this is NOT the final gift UI and no Focus credit is stored to NVS.
endmenu
